@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:てめぇ……<br>ウチがやったって<br>言ってんのか？|#0103Trial03_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR4,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:だって一番<br>怪しいんだから、<br>疑うのは当然じゃん。|#0103Trial03_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR4,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……あんただったら<br>好きなタイミングで<br>火を<br>燃え上がらせる事だって<br>できるわけだし？|#0103Trial03_Coco003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_01_03_03_01\">燃やして証拠隠滅</link><br>しようと思った<br>って、<br>簡単にできんのは<br>あんたしかいねーんだよ！|#0103Trial03_Coco004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Gross_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"それとも<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_03_02\">勝手に燃え上がった</link><br>とか言うわけ！？<br>んなことあるわけ<br>ないじゃん！|#0103Trial03_Coco005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR9,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……燃える時間を<br>自由に<link=\"Objection_01_03_03_03\">調整</link><br>できるほど<br>器用じゃねーよ。|#0103Trial03_Alisa002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
